"tender": {
"id": "tender_519756/1626556",
"title": "Home Office Core Testing Capability Services (Lots 1 & 2)",
"description": "The Home Office is conducting a mini-competition via the GCA&apos;s Quality Assurance & Testing for IT Systems 2 DPS, RM6148.\r\n\r\nThe outcome of the tender shall see the Home Office award 2 Call-Off Contracts to two different suppliers to provide quality assurance, quality engineering and testing services for applications and systems across the Home Office. \r\n\r\nEach contract will support a distinct set of service areas/portfolios within the Home Office, and shall include the provision of resource augmentation and managed services.\r\n\r\nEach contract will have a maximum value of £150m with an initial duration of 3 years, and a further extension option of 1-year.\r\n\r\nThe contract value does not indicate a level of committed spend, as all services shall be commissioned via Statements of Work under the contract, setting our deliverables, team profiles, and the applicable charging/payment method. \r\n\r\nFor instructions on how to access the tender documents, please refer to the Joining Instructions that are attached to this Notice.",
